      "marker": "3",
      "text": "By approval of the graduate committee, biological physics students may substitute graduate courses in biology, physics, or chemistry from the following list instead of Physics of Biological Processes and Living Systems 2 (PHYS 7741): Biochemistry (BIOL 6300) Molecular Cell Biology (BIOL 6301) Molecular Modeling (CHEM 5638) Additional appropriate courses may also be substituted by approval of the physics graduate committee.",
